From: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: vendor-prefixes: Add Seekwave

Seekwave Technology makes the SV6160 Lite (SWT6621S) SDIO Wi-Fi and
Bluetooth chip found on Rockchip TV boxes.

Signed-off-by: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
@@ -1485,6 +1485,8 @@
     description: Seagate Technology PLC
   "^seeed,.*":
     description: Seeed Technology Co., Ltd
+  "^seekwave,.*":
+    description: Seekwave Technology Co., Ltd.
   "^seirobotics,.*":
     description: Shenzhen SEI Robotics Co., Ltd
   "^semtech,.*":
